  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">R&#xe9;ponse Rapide aux besoins de protection, Abris, AME et Gestion et Coordination des sites (CCCM) des populations d&#xe9;plac&#xe9;es victimes du conflit au Nord-Kivu, Sud-Kivu et en Ituri.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide Shelter/NFI, CCCM and Protection assistance to vulnerable people affected by displacement in the Democratic Republic of the Congo. This UNHCR project provides emergency shelter and dignity kits, strengthens community-based protection in formal and informal sites, provides multi-purpose cash, and supports site and information management at displacement camps. The project provides life-saving assistance to 30,000 people in the Shelter/NFI, 38,000 people in the Protection, and 188,000 people in the CCCM sectors.</narrative>
  </description>
